  "goodToKnow": "Der Takt is the beat or bar in music: im Takt (in time), der Dreivierteltakt (three-four time, the waltz). Transport uses it for regular intervals: Die S-Bahn fährt im 20-Minuten-Takt. Der Takt also means tact: Er hat keinen Takt. Taktvoll means tactful, and taktlos tactless. Der Taktstock is a conductor's baton. Don't confuse it with die Taktik (tactics)."
